<title>NETHERLANDS: HEINEKEN SEES 1996 NET LOWER THAN 1995.</title>
<headline>HEINEKEN SEES 1996 NET LOWER THAN 1995.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch brewer Heineken NV said on Friday it expected 1996 full-year net profit to be &quot;somewhat&quot; lower than 1995's 664 million guilders.</p>
<p>The group earlier announced six percent rise in first half net to 297 million guilders, below analysts' expectations.</p>
